/* Twi027: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing three standalone EDGE_CURVE entities whose vertices form a closed equilateral triangle in 3D; no EDGE_LOOP, no FACE_BOUND, no ADVANCED_FACE, no OPEN_SHELL — bare standalone edges IS the mechanism; EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET which IS the shape item; ConnectEdgesToWires pass must emit a diagnostic on INTERNAL-only edge compound; kernel must warn and return empty result, not crash silently */
